ATTRIBUTION:

Original Project: nav-item by eooce (https://github.com/eooce/nav-item)
Current Project: SmartNavora by zczy-k (https://github.com/zczy-k/SmartNavora)

Changes from the original project include:
- Rewritten frontend (Vue 3 + Vite) and REST API (Express)
- AI-assisted card generation with multi-provider adapters
- Browser extension: single-instance pinned new-tab, right-click save,
  bookmark manager and import
- Local icon fetching service with disk cache and letter fallback
- SSE real-time data sync, layered browser caching and build-stamp self-heal
- Scheduled backups with WebDAV cloud sync, operation audit log sharding
- Docker multi-arch images, Linux and Serv00 deployment scripts

